{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gi5sgYU7wBhXEMkwZgmTcv","type":"tool_result","content":"# The starter game's level: a room file (every field: rooms/_template.toml). Column = x (east),\n# row = z (south), 1 cell = 1 m. `o` cells are shards and `P` is the start (legend markers,\n# read by starter.rs with `scenes::markers`); the slimes are [[npc]] entries the game drives.\n# Check it with `pav room_check path=crates/pav_core/src/games/starter.toml`.\n\nname = \"Starter\"\nabout = \"Collect every shard while slimes chase you.\"\nentrance = { at = [8, 12], facing = \"south\" }   # required by the format; the `P` marker is the start\n\n# The rules' numbers (starter.rs `Rules`). Running from the repository, `pav` reads this file at\n# each `load`: edit, then `load scene=starter` or `play bot=true seeds=10`, no rebuild.\n[game]\nlives = 3\nslime_speed = 0.5\nslime_sight = 9.0\ncatch = 0.8\npick = 0.9\ngrace = 2.0\n\n[camera]\ntilt = 58.0\ndistance = 17.0\n\n[layout]\norigin = [-9.0, 0.0, -6.5]\n\n[[layout.layer]]\ny = 0\nmap = '''\n##################\n#o......#.......o#\n#.......#........#\n#..##.......##...#\n#..#.........#...#\n#.......o........#\n#....#.....#.....#\n#.......P........#\n#..#.........#...#\n#..##.......##...#\n#.......#........#\n#o......#.......o#\n##################\n'''\n\n[layout.legend.'.']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\n\n[layout.legend.'#']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }, { y0 = 0, y1 = 1.2, color = \"#8a6f9e\", rounded = true }]\n\n[layout.legend.'o']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\nmarker = \"shard\"\n\n[layout.legend.'P']\nblocks = [{ y0 = -0.5, y1 = 0, color = \"#3b4a5c\" }]\nmarker = \"player\"\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [12.5, 0, 2.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [5.5, 0, 10.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n\n[[npc]]\nname = \"slime\"\nkind = \"blob\"\npos = [15.5, 0, 7.5]\nlook = { skin = \"#6cd66c\" }\n98:# look = \"flat\" | \"cel\" | \"lit\" | \"unlit\",\n122:#   note = \"...\"      pads: what it sets and what to look for (on screen while you stand on it;\n168:# The clip browser (rooms/clip_browser.toml; body = \"none\"): every [[npc]] whose name starts with\n175:# [[npc]]: look = { figure = \"LIB/kaykit_adventurers/knight\" }.\n268:# look = any puppet setting over the kind's preset: colours (skin, shirt, pants, shoes, eyes,\n271:# anim_fps = 12 for \"on twos\") and look = \"cel\" | \"flat\" | \"lit\" | \"cutout\". A biped can hold a\n272:# library object by its grip socket: look = { weapon = { kind = \"staff\", asset = \"LIB/core/mage_staff\" } }.\n273:# Performers: clips = [\"SET/Clip\", ...] (the clips tool lists them), moves = [...], hold = 5 (s).\n276:# [[npc]]\n281:# look = { accent = \"#3bb273\", leg_length = 1.0 }\nrooms/clip_browser.toml\nrooms/secondary.toml\nrooms/filter_bench.toml\n209-color = \"#aeb6c8\"\n210-\n211-[[npc]]\n212-name = \"cast_puppet\"\n213-pos = [3.0, 0.25, 3.5]\n214-yaw = 0\n215:look = { shirt = \"#e0a040\", pants = \"#2a2a3a\", skin = \"#d8a07a\" }\n216-\n217-[[npc]]\n218-name = \"cast_knight\"\n219-pos = [7.0, 0.25, 3.5]\n220-yaw = 0\n221-look = { figure = \"LIB/kaykit_adventurers/knight\" }\n{\"foundations\":{\"barrel\":[\"barrel 60x91x60 bands=iron/brass :brass\",\"cask 64x73x64 girth=18-48 height=40-120 :keg :tun\",\"tap_barrel 97x70x60 size=0.6-1.2 :hogshead :keg\",\"wash_tub 63x52x63 diameter=40-96 fill=water/empty :dry :small :wide\"],\"bed\":[\"cot 190x54x77 style=cot/bedroll/bed :bed :bedroll :cot\"],\"container\":[\"bucket 34x39x31 fill=water/empty height=20-45 style=wood/iron :pail :tall\",\"trough 180x54x64 fill=water/hay/empty length=100-240 material=wood/stone :feed :short :stone\",\"cooking_pot 34x42x30 fill=stew/empty hang=stand/hang size=25-70 :kettle :large\"],\"crate\":[\"crate_stack 122x167x122 stack=seed/no/yes :single\",\"chest 88x66x55 lid=closed/open wi