on3 gen/about.py` (writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json), rebuild, rerun web tests\n- [ ] Copy tests/out/game.html to the deliverable name in work root; delete engine/target, gen/, tests/out, tests/hub/game.html\n\n## Build commands\n- pav: `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --offline -p pav_tools --bin pav`\n- page: `tests/build_page.sh` -> tests/out/game.html (run in background)\n- tests: `python3 tests/run_all.py [--rust] [--web] [--hub]` (run web/hub in background with a log)\n\n## Notes for feedback (testing tally so far)\n1 tumor ring never spawned, Case 3 unwinnable (bot test; critical). 2 laser band too narrow (rule test). 3 IV never used by the campaign (coverage). 4 egui TexturesDelta drop panic in UI tests. 5 highlight blobs too strong (screenshot). 6 glasses hid the eyes (screenshot). 7 characters sat behind the dialogue box (screenshot). 8 low-skill bot won everything; Case 4 impossible at 0.7 (balance). 9 no margin in par (balance). 10 chart ignored quick confirm (browser). 11 presses missed at low fps: tests made frame-aware. 12 leftover pages starved later browser tests.\nEngine changed: input.rs (surgeons, SurgeryCmd), frame.rs (Cue, surgery frame), sim.rs (frame, push_events), games/mod.rs, simhost.rs (surgery_cmds), build.rs (emit, add_events), session.rs + headless.rs (shell, camera), pav_audio (buses, formants, vibrato, cues, music, voices), app.rs (branch to product.rs, title), settings.rs (default scene), pack_single_html.py + index.html (hub client, tags, shim, about).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1374,"cache_read_input_tokens":787043,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1374},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null