` -> tests/out/game.html\n- about: `python3 gen/about.py` writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json from ../exit-interview.json\n- tests: `python3 tests/run_all.py [--rust] [--web] [--hub]` (run web/hub in background with a log)\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":28,"newStart":4,"newLines":21,"lines":[" Dev folder: DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049/ (engine/ is the clone; gen/ is one-off generators, delete at end; tests/ holds hub files, browser tests, out/)"," Deliverables in work root:"," - DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049.html","-- exit-interview.json","+- exit-interview.json (written; final testing feedback in it)"," ","-## Build order (PLAN.md section 12)","-- [x] Core sim: engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/{mod,field,heart,tune,content,paper,cue,director,story,bot,frame,net,surgeon}.rs, strain/*, content/*. Tests: crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs","-- [x] View: pav_view/src/surgery/{mod,plate,instruments,strains,paper,fx}.rs","-- [x] Shell + HUD: pav_ui/src/surgery/* (tests in surgery/tests.rs)","-- [x] Audio: pav_audio/src/{cues,music,voice}.rs + buses in lib.rs","-- [x] App: pav_app/src/product.rs (own frame path), hub.rs (session, test hook, storage, rumble)","-- [x] Page: web/hub_shim.js, web/session.js, scripts/pack_single_html.py injects tags, shim, about block","-- [x] Tools: pav case_check, pav balance, pav surgeon; content/README.md (designer guide)","-- [x] tests/run_all.py (--rust --web --hub), tests/browser/{common,web_tests,hub_tests}.py, tests/build_page.sh (waits for memory; earlyoom kills big compiles)","-- [x] Harness passes all 4 scenarios. web tests: 9/11 at last full run; dev_mode + screenshots being rerun (tests/out/web2.log); two-copy hub test filter fixed, rerun with `python3 tests/browser/hub_tests.py`","-- [ ] Look check at 1080p from tests/out/p_*.png: HUD, story, results, dev, about","-- [ ] Final balance: `pav balance seeds=6 skills=1.0,0.7,0.4`, set par in case files (avg/1.08 less margin)","-- [ ] exit-interview.json in work root, then `python3 gen/about.py` (writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json), rebuild, rerun web tests","-- [ ] Copy tests/out/game.html to the deliverable name in work root; delete engine/target, gen/, tests/out, tests/hub/game.html","+## State","+All build steps done (sim, view, shell, audio, app, hub, tools, designer guide, balance, About block).","+Rust: 51 passed at last run (`python3 tests/run_all.py --rust`)."," ","+## Remaining","+- [ ] Final web + hub pass running: tests/out/web.log, tests/out/hub.log (ends with DONE). Fix anything real; rebuild with tests/build_page.sh","+- [ ] Look at tests/out/p_results.png, p_about.png, c4-style wide shot","+- [ ] Copy tests/out/game.html to the deliverable name in work root; check it opens from file://","+- [ ] Delete engine/target, gen/, tests/out, tests/hub/game.html","+- [ ] Final reply: Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback (copy from exit-interview.json)","+"," ## Build commands"," - pav: `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --offline -p pav_tools --bin pav`","-- page: `tests/build_page.sh` -> tests/out/game.html (run in background)","+- page: `tests/build_page.sh` -> tests/out/game.html","+- about: `python3 gen/about.py` writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json from ../exit-interview.json"," - tests: `python3 tests/run_all.py [--rust] [--web] [--hub]` (run web/hub in background with a log)","-","-## Notes for feedback (testing tally so far)","-1 tumor ring never spawned, Case 3 unwinnable (bot test; critical). 2 laser band too narrow (rule test). 3 IV never used by the campaign (coverage). 4 egui TexturesDelta drop panic in UI tests. 5 highlight blobs too strong (screenshot). 6 glasses hid the eyes (screenshot). 7 characters sat behind the dialogue box (screenshot). 8 low-skill bot won everything; Case 4 impossible at 0.7 (balance). 9 no margin in par (balance). 10 chart ignored quick confirm (browser). 11 presses missed at low fps: tests made frame-aware. 12 leftover pages starved later browser tests.","-Engine changed: input.rs (surgeons, SurgeryCmd), frame.rs (Cue, surgery frame), sim.rs (frame, push_events), games/mod.rs, simhost.rs (surgery_cmds), build.rs (emit, add_events), session.rs + headless.rs (shell, camera), pav_audio (buses, formants, vibrato, cues, music, voices), app.rs (branch to product.rs, title), settings.rs (default scene), pack_single_html.py + index.html (hub client, tags, shim, about)."]}],"originalFile":"# Progress\n\nTitle (picked by secrets.randbelow out of 50): **Diorama Center: Second Opinion**\nDev folder: DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049/ (engine/ is the clone; gen/ is one-off generators, delete at end; tests/ holds hub files, browser tests, out/)\nDeliverables in work root:\n- DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049.html\n- exit-interview.json\n\n## Build order (PLAN.md section 12)\n- [x] Core sim: engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/{mod,field,heart,tune,content,paper,cue,director,story,bot,frame,net,surgeon}.rs, strain/*, content/*. Tests: crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs\n- [x] View: pav_view/src/surgery/{mod,plate,instruments,strains,paper,fx}.rs\n- [x] Shell + HUD: pav_ui/src/surgery/* (tests in surgery/tests.rs)\n- [x] Audio: pav_audio/src/{cues,music,voice}.rs + buses in lib.rs\n- [x] App: pav_app/src/product.rs (own frame path), hub.rs (session, test hook, storage, rumble)\n- [x] Page: web/hub_shim.js, web/session.js, scripts/pack_single_html.py injects tags, shim, about block\n- [x] Tools: pav case_check, pav balance, pav surgeon; content/README.md (designer guide)\n- [x] tests/run_all.py (--rust --web --hub), tests/browser/{common,web_tests,hub_tests}.py, tests/build_page.sh (waits for memory; earlyoom kills big compiles)\n- [x] Harness passes all 4 scenarios. web tests: 9/11 at last full run; dev_mode + screenshots being rerun (tests/out/web2.log); two-copy hub test filter fixed, rerun with `python3 tests/browser/hub_tests.py`\n- [ ] Look check at 1080p from tests/out/p_*.png: HUD, story, results, dev, about\n- [ ] Final balance: `pav balance seeds=6 skills=1.0,0.7,0.4`, set par in case files (avg/1.08 less margin)\n- [ ] exit-interview.json in work root, then `python3 gen/about.py` (writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json), rebuild, rerun web tests\n- [ ] Copy tests/out/game.html to the deliverable name in work root; delete engine/target, gen/, tests/out, tests/hub/game.html\n\n## Build commands\n- pav: `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --offline -p pav_tools --bin pav`\n- page: `tests/build_page.sh` -> tests/out/game.html (run in background)\n- tests: `python3 tests/run_all.py [--rust] [--web] [--hub]` (run web/hub in background with a log)\n\n## Notes for feedback (testing tally so far)\n1 tumor ring never spawned, Case 3 unwinnable (bot test; critical). 2 laser band too narrow (rule test). 3 IV never used by the campaign (coverage). 4 egui TexturesDelta drop panic in UI tests. 5 highlight blobs too strong (screenshot). 6 glasses hid the eyes (screenshot). 7 characters sat behind the dialogue box (screenshot). 8 low-skill bot won everything; Case 4 impossible at 0.7 (balance). 9 no margin in par (balance). 10 chart ignored quick confirm (browser). 11 presses missed at low fps: tests made frame-aware. 12 leftover pages starved later browser tests.\nEngine changed: input.rs (surgeons, SurgeryCmd), frame.rs (Cue, surgery frame), sim.rs (frame, push_events), games/mod.rs, simhost.rs (surgery_cmds), build.rs (emit, add_events), session.rs + headless.rs (shell, camera), pav_audio (buses, formants, vibrato, cues, music, voices), app.rs (branch to product.rs, title), settings.rs (default scene), pack_single_html.py + index.html (hub client, tags, shim, about).\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LQwaWbMMJWVtgUf7oGi3he","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
