ser tests, out/)","-Deliverables in work root:","-- DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049.html","-- exit-interview.json (written; final testing feedback in it)"," ","-## State","-All build steps done (sim, view, shell, audio, app, hub, tools, designer guide, balance, About block).","-Rust: 51 passed at last run (`python3 tests/run_all.py --rust`).","+## Done","+Everything in PLAN.md's build order, with every test passing on the final build (69 passed, 0 failed: Rust, browser, hub harness, two-copy session)."," ","-## Remaining","-- [ ] Final web + hub pass running: tests/out/web.log, tests/out/hub.log (ends with DONE). Fix anything real; rebuild with tests/build_page.sh","-- [ ] Look at tests/out/p_results.png, p_about.png, c4-style wide shot","-- [ ] Copy tests/out/game.html to the deliverable name in work root; check it opens from file://","-- [ ] Delete engine/target, gen/, tests/out, tests/hub/game.html","-- [ ] Final reply: Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback (copy from exit-interview.json)","+Handed in, in this folder:","+- DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049.html","+- exit-interview.json"," ","-## Build commands","-- pav: `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --offline -p pav_tools --bin pav`","-- page: `tests/build_page.sh` -> tests/out/game.html","-- about: `python3 gen/about.py` writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json from ../exit-interview.json","-- tests: `python3 tests/run_all.py [--rust] [--web] [--hub]` (run web/hub in background with a log)","+Dev folder: DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049/","+- engine/: the changed engine, source only (engine/target deleted)","+- tests/: run_all.py, build_page.sh, about.py, browser/, hub/","+- Designer guide: engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/README.md","+","+To work on it again: `tests/build_page.sh` rebuilds the page into tests/out/game.html; `python3 tests/run_all.py` runs everything; `python3 tests/about.py` regenerates the About block from exit-interview.json."]}],"originalFile":"# Progress\n\nTitle (picked by secrets.randbelow out of 50): **Diorama Center: Second Opinion**\nDev folder: DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049/ (engine/ is the clone; gen/ is one-off generators, delete at end; tests/ holds hub files, browser tests, out/)\nDeliverables in work root:\n- DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049.html\n- exit-interview.json (written; final testing feedback in it)\n\n## State\nAll build steps done (sim, view, shell, audio, app, hub, tools, designer guide, balance, About block).\nRust: 51 passed at last run (`python3 tests/run_all.py --rust`).\n\n## Remaining\n- [ ] Final web + hub pass running: tests/out/web.log, tests/out/hub.log (ends with DONE). Fix anything real; rebuild with tests/build_page.sh\n- [ ] Look at tests/out/p_results.png, p_about.png, c4-style wide shot\n- [ ] Copy tests/out/game.html to the deliverable name in work root; check it opens from file://\n- [ ] Delete engine/target, gen/, tests/out, tests/hub/game.html\n- [ ] Final reply: Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback (copy from exit-interview.json)\n\n## Build commands\n- pav: `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --offline -p pav_tools --bin pav`\n- page: `tests/build_page.sh` -> tests/out/game.html\n- about: `python3 gen/about.py` writes engine/web/about.json + pav_ui about.json from ../exit-interview.json\n- tests: `python3 tests/run_all.py [--rust] [--web] [--hub]` (run web/hub in background with a log)\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SKxtTkjR4e6cBwEaFgbsKg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
