{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ShaWRS8L4V4RhBnKWaQte7","type":"tool_result","content":"## Add a case\nCopy `cases/case0.toml`. The top sets the `surgeon` (`mara`, `pet`, `both`), `plate`, the eight\ninstruments of the `ring` (clockwise from up), `timer` in seconds, `par` (the score ranks are\npercentages of: take it from `pav balance`), the patient's chart and `fate` lines, and the `before`\nand `after` story scenes. `guided = true` highlights targets; `gift = true` wakes the gift at once.\n\nEach `[[phase]]` has an `objective` (the NOW line), `checkpoint = true` if a death retries from here,\n`plate` to cross-fade to, `meter` for the monitor, a `strain`, a list of `[[phase.spawn]]` and a list of\n`[[phase.event]]`. A phase ends when every required hazard and the strain are gone.\n\n- Spawn kinds: `incision laceration pool bleeder foreign polyp tumor burn bone nodule sac crown eye ember\n--- about to delete\n2.7G\tengine/target\n23M\ttests/out\ntests/browser/__pycache__\ntests/hub/game.html\n!! target/\ntests/hub:\nREADME.md\nbridge.js\ngame.html\nharness.html\nround.js\nsession.js\n\ntests/out:\nbuild.log\nfinal_check.py\ngame.html\np_about.png\np_dev.png\np_menu.png\np_op.png\np_pause.png\np_results.png\np_story.png\np_title.png\np_wide.png\nrun_all.log","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"092dc2e9-85ec-49f9-8a5e-82413bbc454c","uuid":"561af2b1-228d-4413-a087-e7886a4e783f","timestamp":"2026-11-05T21:10:45.805Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## Add a case\nCopy `cases/case0.toml`. The top sets the `surgeon` (`mara`, `pet`, `both`), `plate`, the eight\ninstruments of the `ring` (clockwise from up), `timer` in seconds, `par` (the score ranks are\npercentages of: take it from `pav balance`), the patient's chart and `fate` lines, and the `before`\nand `after` story scenes. `guided = true` highlights targets; `gift = true` wakes the gift at once.\n\nEach `[[phase]]` has an `objective` (the NOW line), `checkpoint = true` if a death retries from here,\n`plate` to cross-fade to, `meter` for the monitor, a `strain`, a list of `[[phase.spawn]]` and a list of\n`[[phase.event]]`. A phase ends when every required hazard and the strain are gone.\n\n- Spawn kinds: `incision laceration pool bleeder foreign polyp tumor burn bone nodule sac crown eye ember\n--- about to delete\n2.7G\tengine/target\n23M\ttests/out\ntests/browser/__pycache__\ntests/hub/game.html\n!! target/\ntests/hub:\nREADME.md\nbridge.js\ngame.html\nharness.html\nround.js\nsession.js\n\ntests/out:\nbuild.log\nfinal_check.py\ngame.html\np_about.png\np_dev.png\np_menu.png\np_op.png\np_pause.png\np_results.png\np_story.png\np_title.png\np_wide.png\nrun_all.log","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ShaWRS8L4V4RhBnKWaQte7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
