{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkU6bPWQcQNa9aHSHNHC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JDVRuJYjTH2fvuDAHuU43h","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-063049__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json","offset":19,"limit":6},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1723,"cache_read_input_tokens":282354,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1723},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"092dc2e9-85ec-49f9-8a5e-82413bbc454c","uuid":"e5eb37dc-da1f-461d-9645-69ef9897212c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T21:10:57.114Z","request_id":"req_011CgkU6azgcYFnV5Punr3MM","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JDVRuJYjTH2fvuDAHuU43h":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-063049__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json","offset":19,"limit":6}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JDVRuJYjTH2fvuDAHuU43h","type":"tool_result","content":"19\t  \"testingFeedback\": [\n20\t    \"About 35. The ones that mattered: the tumor's ring cut was never spawned, so Case 3 could not be finished; the closing dressing locked out the IV, so a low-vitals player was stuck until death; touch taps missed the Settings button because the canvas was not sized the way the pointer events assumed; slow frames kept hub copies from calling ready in time; the title clipped on a phone; the attract timer ran slow on slow frames; menu repeats overshot on stalled frames; the campaign never used the IV; glasses hid the eyes; the wide-shot camera sat behind a wall. Found late, from a table of every difficulty and skill: pumping the IV paid more than surgery, so slow play ranked above good play; slow bots swapped tools without finishing anything; bursts in Case 4 drained faster than the IV could heal, which made it harder than the final case; and freezing every ember first skipped the merge twist in Case 6. Plus a dozen balance and test-harness fixes.\",\n21\t    \"4: the unfinishable Case 3 tumor, the dressing lock, phone taps missing the only button on that screen, and four-player hub rounds failing the harness. The IV score farm broke the ranks, not the game, so I don't count it here.\",\n22\t    \"The bot playing every case and the whole campaign with coverage counters, together with the balance tool. It runs in seconds, found the unfinishable case and the dressing lock, and told me what to change after every rule edit. Printing wins and times per difficulty and skill, rather than only pass or fail against targets, is what exposed the score farm and the difficulty spike.\",\n23\t    \"Browser tests that waited on real time before I made them count frames: software WebGPU on this busy machine ran at about 1 to 10 frames a second, so they mostly measured the machine. The WebKit iPhone load also told me little, because it stops at the page's WebGPU message.\"\n24\t  ],"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"092dc2e9-85ec-49f9-8a5e-82413bbc454c","uuid":"4d763d52-8365-4759-a033-3650b1f57846","timestamp":"2026-11-05T21:10:57.121Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-063049__x42677a/work/exit-interview.json","content":"  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"About 35. The ones that mattered: the tumor's ring cut was never spawned, so Case 3 could not be finished; the closing dressing locked out the IV, so a low-vitals player was stuck until death; touch taps missed the Settings button because the canvas was not sized the way the pointer events assumed; slow frames kept hub copies from calling ready in time; the title clipped on a phone; the attract timer ran slow on slow frames; menu repeats overshot on stalled frames; the campaign never used the IV; glasses hid the eyes; the wide-shot camera sat behind a wall. Found late, from a table of every difficulty and skill: pumping the IV paid more than surgery, so slow play ranked above good play; slow bots swapped tools without finishing anything; bursts in Case 4 drained faster than the IV could heal, which made it harder than the final case; and freezing every ember first skipped the merge twist in Case 6. Plus a dozen balance and test-harness fixes.\",\n    \"4: the unfinishable Case 3 tumor, the dressing lock, phone taps missing the only button on that screen, and four-player hub rounds failing the harness. The IV score farm broke the ranks, not the game, so I don't count it here.\",\n    \"The bot playing every case and the whole campaign with coverage counters, together with the balance tool. It runs in seconds, found the unfinishable case and the dressing lock, and told me what to change after every rule edit. Printing wins and times per difficulty and skill, rather than only pass or fail against targets, is what exposed the score farm and the difficulty spike.\",\n    \"Browser tests that waited on real time before I made them count frames: software WebGPU on this busy machine ran at about 1 to 10 frames a second, so they mostly measured the machine. The WebKit iPhone load also told me little, because it stops at the page's WebGPU message.\"\n  ],","numLines":6,"startLine":19,"totalLines":59}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JDVRuJYjTH2fvuDAHuU43h","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
