: 5} | ev [(0.3, 'pet', []), (7.0, 'pet', [])] | {}\n 1 Marrow: Cysts in the marrow. Laser them. | {'polyp': 6} | ev [(0.3, 'bashir', []), ('?', 'pet', ['remaining', 'gift', 'cue', 'shake'])] | {'checkpoint': True}\n 2 The Echo: Your hands split. Take the Echo: whatever you do, they do again. | {'laceration': 4, 'polyp': 4, 'burn': 1} | ev [(1.4, 'bashir', []), (5, 'pet', [])] | {'checkpoint': True}\n 3 Second Growth: They came back, faster. So did you. | {'polyp': 8, 'foreign': 2, 'pool': 1, 'burn': 1} | ev [(0.3, 'teddy', []), ('?', 'pet', ['remaining'])] | {'checkpoint': True}\n 4 Close: Set the last piece and dress it. | {'bone': 2, 'laceration': 1, 'closure': 1} | ev [] | {'checkpoint': True}\n\n== case6.toml Dies Irae timer 420 ring ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'suction', 'cryo', 'gel', 'laser', 'iv'] guided None gift True\n 0 Open: Open the sac. Soothe the burns. | {'incision': 1, 'burn': 2, 'polyp': 2, 'laceration': 1} | ev [(0.3, 'voss', []), (4, 'pet', [])] | {}\n 1 Embers: Cryoprobe an ember, Scalpel to crack it, Forceps the pieces. Lift on the ring. | {} | ev [(0.3, 'teddy', ['banner', 'cue']), (6, 'pet', [])] | {'checkpoint': True, 'meter': 5, 'strain': {'kind': 'dies_irae', 'count': 5, 'rings': 5, 'fever': 0.9, 'furnace': True, 'at': [0, 0.2]}}\n 2 Scorched Earth: Her pericardium is cinders. Soothe it, stitch it. | {'burn': 5, 'laceration': 2, 'bleeder': 1, 'pool': 1} | ev [(0.3, 'voss', []), (3.2, 'pet', [])] | {'checkpoint': True}\n 3 Close: Close the sac. | {'laceration': 2, 'closure': 1} | ev [(0.3, 'voss', [])] | {'checkpoint': True}\n\n== case7.toml Libera Me timer 540 ring ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'suction', 'laser', 'gel', 'cryo', 'iv'] guided None gift True\n 0 A: Introit: Pools and nodules. Laser at rest, Forceps within two beats. | {'pool': 2} | ev [(0.3, 'teddy', ['banner']), (5, 'pet', [])] | {'meter': 3, 'strain': {'kind': 'introit', 'waves': 3, 'amen': False, 'visible': True, 'tough': 0.8, 'at': [0, 0.2]}}\n 1 A: Interlude: It's bleeding where it walked. Close the wounds. Stay with him. | {'laceration': 2, 'bleeder': 1, 'pool': 1, 'burn': 1} | ev [(0.3, 'teddy', [])] | {}\n 2 B: Lacrimosa: Sacs on the coronaries. Take the stems. Cut the eye. | {} | ev [(0.3, 'teddy', ['banner'])] | {'checkpoint': True, 'meter': 6, 'strain': {'kind': 'lacrimosa', 'waves': 2, 'count': 5, 'beats': 14, 'at': [0.2, 0.2]}}\n 3 C: Dies Irae: Embers and rings, in seven. Lift on the ring. | {} | ev [(0.3, 'pet', ['banner'])] | {'checkpoint': True, 'meter': 7, 'strain': {'kind': 'dies_irae', 'count': 3, 'rings': 7, 'fever': 0, 'at': [0, 0.2]}}\n 4 C: Interlude: Cool him down. Then get ready: it's going quiet. | {'burn': 3, 'polyp': 2, 'laceration': 1} | ev [(0.3, 'mara', [])] | {'checkpoint': True}\n 5 D: Stopped: It stopped the heart on purpose. Three shocks, each on the ghost. | {} | ev [(0.2, 'mara', [])] | {'checkpoint': True, 'strain': {'kind': 'shocks', 'count': 3}}\n 6 E: The Soloist: The Soloist. Scalpel on the beat. Then the spine, in diastole. | {} | ev [(0.2, 'pet', ['banner', 'cue', 'shake']), (3, 'mara', []), (4.5, None, ['gift'])] | {'checkpoint': True, 'meter': 4, 'strain': {'kind': 'soloist', 'count': 14, 'beats': 6, 'at': [0, 0.2]}}\n 7 Close: Close him. Dress it. | {'laceration': 2, 'closure': 1} | ev [(0.4, 'bashir', ['cue']), (3, 'teddy', [])] | {}\n\n== codeblue.toml Code Blue timer 240 ring ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'suction', 'laser', 'gel', 'scanner', 'iv'] guided None gift True\n 0 Triage: Keep the patient alive until the bell. | {} | ev [(0.3, 'bashir', [])] | {}\n[[phase.spawn]]\nkind = \"burn\"\nat = [-4.2, -0.5]\nr = 0.9\ntag = \"inflammation\"\n[[phase.spawn]]\nkind = \"burn\"\nat = [0.4, 1.2]\nr = 0.85\ntag = \"inflammation\"\n[[phase.spawn]]\nkind = \"burn\"\nat = [4.6, -0.9]\nr = 0.9\ntag = \"inflammation\"\n[[phase.event]]\nat_time = 0.2\nsay = [\"bashir\", \"Gel, Doctor. Flick it, then paint until the ring is full.\"]\n\n[[phase]]\nname = \"Hooks\"\nobjective = \"Forceps.