{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkVMSUm95n8N9tF5H9XE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NcnTZvTxER1SVYiSgE5qmZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-063049__x42677a/work/DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport pathlib, json, re\ndef line(who, expr, text):\n    o = \"[[line]]\\n\" + f'who = \"{who}\"\\n'\n    if expr: o += f'expr = \"{expr}\"\\n'\n    return o + f\"text = {json.dumps(text, ensure_ascii=False)}\\n\"\ndef stage(**kw):\n    return \"[[line]]\\n\" + \"\".join(f'{k} = {json.dumps(v)}\\n' for k,v in kw.items())\ndef after(scene, frag, *blocks):\n    p = pathlib.Path(f\"story/{scene}.toml\")\n    t = p.read_text()\n    enc = json.dumps(frag, ensure_ascii=False)[1:-1]\n    hits = [m for m in re.finditer(r'^text = \".*$', t, re.M) if m.group(0).startswith('text = \"' + enc)]\n    if len(hits) != 1:\n        hits = [m for m in re.finditer(r'^text = \".*$', t, re.M) if enc in m.group(0)]\n    assert len(hits) == 1, (scene, frag, len(hits))\n    j = hits[0].end() + 1\n    p.write_text(t[:j] + \"\".join(blocks) + t[j:])\n\nafter(\"case2_before\", \"He's got most of a conveyor\",\n  line(\"mara\",\"alarmed\",\"For the lunch tins.\"),\n  line(\"teddy\",\"alarmed\",\"Eleven tins! He had them all in his coat! He wouldn't let the paramedics take the coat!\"))\nafter(\"case2_after\", \"Thank you.\",\n  stage(enter=\"teddy\", at=\"farright\"),\n  line(\"teddy\",\"soft\",\"They found the coat. All eleven tins, not a dent. One of them's got your name on it now, in grease pencil. I wouldn't open it. I'd frame it. But I wouldn't open it.\"),\n  line(\"mara\",\"soft\",\"What's in it?\"),\n  line(\"teddy\",\"neutral\",\"Sardines. And, I think, respect.\"),\n  stage(exit=\"teddy\"))\nafter(\"case3_before\", \"I had a good nurse.\",\n  line(\"vane\",\"soft\",\"Everyone says that. Almost no one means it. Do have the little ones with the fig. I had them flown in, and I've been told that's obscene.\"))\nafter(\"case3_before\", \"Cordelia Vane smiled,\",\n  stage(enter=\"teddy\", at=\"farright\"),\n  line(\"teddy\",\"soft\",\"I've had nine of the fig things. Does anyone know what they cost? I'm asking as a person who just ate about a car.\"),\n  stage(exit=\"teddy\"))\nafter(\"case3_before\", \"It says so on the film.\",\n  line(\"mara\",\"neutral\",\"That's a lot of places to say it.\"),\n  line(\"bashir\",\"neutral\",\"Yes, Doctor. That's what I thought.\"))\nafter(\"case3_after\", \"There is no record.\",\n  line(\"bashir\",\"stern\",\"Chief, the patient...\"),\n  line(\"voss\",\"neutral\",\"Is alive, and will be told she had a very ordinary morning. See that she has one.\"))\nafter(\"case3_after\", \"Did she just... did she say she knows?\",\n  line(\"mara\",\"soft\",\"She wasn't surprised. Bashir. A liver got up and walked, and she came down in her good shoes.\"))\nafter(\"case4_before\", \"Someone made this?\",\n  line(\"voss\",\"stern\",\"Someone paid for it to be made. It is not the same thing. It is a good deal worse.\"),\n  line(\"mara\",\"neutral\",\"And when it went quiet. When everything slowed, and I could hear the one note. What was that?\"),\n  line(\"voss\",\"stern\",\"That was you, Doctor. It has a name in my notes. I call it the Hush. It is why you are here, and it is what will put you on the floor, so I would be sparing with it.\"))\nafter(\"case4_after\", \"No.\",\n  line(\"bashir\",\"stern\",\"She's twenty-eight, Chief. She asked me last week if it was normal to hear the radiators.\"),\n  line(\"voss\",\"neutral\",\"And what did you tell her?\"),\n  line(\"bashir\",\"neutral\",\"I told her they want bleeding.\"))\nafter(\"case5_before\", \"I say no to everyone. Look. No.\",\n  line(\"bashir\",\"neutral\",\"I've read your Ostend notes, Doctor. Forty-one hours, eleven tables, on a ferry listing nine degrees.\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"stern\",\"Then you've read fiction. It was twelve tables, and it was fourteen degrees, and I was sick in a bucket between the seventh and the eighth.\"))\nafter(\"case5_before\", \"That's why I'm here.\",\n  line(\"bashir\",\"neutral\",\"Three minutes, Doctor. You lasted three minutes.\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"stern\",\"Be quiet, young man. I'm being appalled.\"))\nafter(\"case5_after\", \"You always did have a flair for appearing twice.\",\n  stage(enter=\"bashir\", at=\"centre\"),\n  line(\"bashir\",\"neutral\",\"The longshoreman will walk, Doctor. He's asking whether he can buy you a drink.\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"soft\",\"Tell him tea. Tell him it has to be terrible.\"),\n  stage(exit=\"bashir\"))\nafter(\"case6_before\", \"You made this.\",\n  line(\"voss\",\"neutral\",\"Say it however you like, Perpetua. I have said it to myself more ways than you know.\"))\nafter(\"case6_before\", \"You'll need my notes.\",\n  line(\"pet\",\"stern\",\"You'll dictate them awake, then. Local only. I want to see your face.\"),\n  line(\"voss\",\"soft\",\"You always did have such a lovely bedside manner.\"))\nafter(\"case6_after\", \"You bleed like a bank.\",\n  line(\"voss\",\"neutral\",\"You could have stopped at the fourth ember. I would have, in your place.\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"stern\",\"I know you would. That's the difference between us, and it's the only one that ever bothered me.\"))\nafter(\"case6_after\", \"She has never once been unkind to me.\",\n  line(\"pet\",\"neutral\",\"Then she's a fool. You're dreadful. Anyone can see it.\"))\nafter(\"case7_before\", \"The flowers. Very nice.\",\n  line(\"teddy\",\"alarmed\",\"They're still up there. They're on the table in the scrub room. They smell amazing. I smelled them! Should I be worried? I smelled them a lot!\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"neutral\",\"Burn them. Then come back and be useful.\"))\nafter(\"case7_before\", \"Good. Stay that way.\",\n  line(\"mara\",\"neutral\",\"He told me a string doesn't care how frightened you are. No. That was my father. Bashir told me to scrub in.\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"stern\",\"Both sound like sensible men. Scrub in.\"))\nafter(\"case7_after\", \"...Hm. I'm keeping this one.\",\n  stage(enter=\"teddy\", at=\"farright\"),\n  line(\"teddy\",\"soft\",\"I handed him a spoon. Just so that's on the record. Halfway through, I handed a dying man's surgeon a spoon, and she used it.\"),\n  line(\"pet\",\"neutral\",\"It was a good spoon.\"))\nafter(\"case7_after\", \"Did... did anybody else just get a chill?\",\n  line(\"mara\",\"soft\",\"Seventy-two. All of you. Do you hear that? It's the first time this building has been in tune.\"),\n  line(\"bashir\",\"neutral\",\"It's the radiator, Doctor.\"),\n  line(\"mara\",\"soft\",\"Yes. I know.\"))\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport tomllib, glob\nn=0; c=0; per={}\nfor f in glob.glob(\"story/*.toml\"):\n    d = tomllib.load(open(f,\"rb\"))\n    k=0\n    for l in d[\"line\"]:\n        if \"text\" in l: n+=1; c+=len(l[\"text\"]); k+=1\n    per[f.split('/')[-1][:-5]]=k\nprint(\"spoken lines\", n, \"characters\", c); print(dict(sorted(per.items())))\nEOF\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-063049__x42677a/work/DioramaCenterSecondOpinion-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-063049/engine; grep -n '\"mug\"\\|TODO' crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/content/story/*.toml | head -3; for i in $(seq 1 40); do a=$(free -m | awk 'NR==2{print $7}'); [ \"$a\" -gt 2500 ] && break; sleep 5; done; CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4 cargo build --offline --locked -p pav_tools --bin pav 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-90; ./target/debug/pav case_check 2>&1 | cut -c1-200 | head -3; ./target/debug/pav balance seeds=12 skills=1.0,0.7,0.5 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nt=sys.stdin.read(); d=json.loads(t[t.index('{'):])\nfor c in d['balance']:\n    print(c['case'],c['name'],'par~',c.get('suggested_par'),'|',' | '.jo